      "content": "i know, i know... i try to tell myself that. but sometimes i just sit here thinking, if i wasn't even here, they could actually have their lives back. mark could sleep, the kids could have a dad who isn't always stressed about bills. it almost feels like the most loving thing i could do would be to just stop being such a burden. like, wouldn't they be better off if they didn't have to worry about me anymore?",
